tion:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"关键次要终点：第16周sPGA达到0或1且较基线改善≥2级的受试者比例。；第16周达到PASI 90应答的受试者比例。","quote_sha256":"9ebc192fbc05715cf7f717f7f5899cd368f8790a1c880b7a2bff3665ad9ac302","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_key_secondary_endpoints"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"次要研究目的：评价合成试验药A对皮损清除程度及皮肤病相关生活质量的影响。","quote_sha256":"f60b7980df919c77b6b4674e5a8a1013c4753590e096ca6566a70adbd1e9b6e4","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_secondary_objective"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"其他次要终点：第16周PASI评分较基线的变化。；第16周DLQI评分较基线的变化。","quote_sha256":"1f739c14310a6a5f292991854360290460a4b501e71c36ec724647d8123a4023","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_other_secondary_endpoints"}],"evidence_span_ids":["span_section_identity","span_visit_strategy","span_primary_endpoint","span_key_secondary_endpoints","span_secondary_objective","span_other_secondary_endpoints"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":5},"gap_items":[{"action":"取得本研究项目特异附录清单或附录编写模板后，补充各附录名称及收录内容","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_appendix_inventory","missing_source_classes":["项目特异附录目录与编写模板"],"target":"项目特异附录的完整目录与收录范围"},{"action":"收集上述量表的正式版本、授权文件及培训材料，核对后纳入附录","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_scale_version_authorization","missing_source_classes":["PASI/sPGA/DLQI量表版本及授权文件","量表评分培训材料"],"target":"PASI、sPGA、DLQI量表版本、授权使用及评分培训材料"},{"action":"确认本项目是否设置相应附录，并取得相应文件后完善附录内容","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_supporting_appendices","missing_source_classes":["实验室手册及知情同意书等配套附录文件"],"target":"实验室手册、参考范围及知情同意书等配套附录文件的收录状态"}],"heading":"项目特异附录","missing_source_classes":["项目特异附录目录与编写模板","PASI/sPGA/DLQI量表版本及授权文件","量表评分培训材料","实验室手册及知情同意书等配套附录文件"],"proposal_text":"项目特异附录收录本研究所用的评价工具及其实施配套文件，使各研究中心按统一标准开展评价与数据记录。本研究采用PASI和sPGA评价斑块状银屑病的严重程度，两项量表的评价时点为基线及第4、8、12、16周；主要终点为第16周达到PASI 75应答（较基线PASI评分改善≥75%）的受试者比例，关键次要终点包括第16周sPGA达到0或1且较基线改善≥2级的受试者比例以及第16周达到PASI 90应答的受试者比例，上述判定均依据本附录所列评分条目与计分规则执行。次要研究目的包括评价合成试验药A对皮损清除程度及皮肤病相关生活质量的影响，第16周DLQI评分较基线的变化列为其他次要终点之一，因此DLQI量表及其评分说明一并纳入本附录，作为生活质量数据采集与评分的依据。各中心在开展上述评价前，应按本附录内容完成评分标准学习，并在原始记录中保留评分依据，保证评价结果的一致性及可溯源。","rationale":"本附录正文依据已确认的评价时点（PASI与sPGA于基线及第4、8、12、16周）、主要终点第16周PASI 75应答、关键次要终点第16周sPGA 0或1且较基线改善≥2级与PASI 90应答、次要目的涵盖皮肤病相关生活质量以及第16周DLQI评分较基线变化这一其他次要终点撰写。医学作者需核对PASI、sPGA、DLQI量表版本与授权、评分培训材料以及附录收录范围。","review_advisories":["本节提及高影响设计信息（主要终点）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_c41ac953b62f7d4d","section_number":"14.5","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:0bbc32d43d7c675bf19f9a1d","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:2410eb4e97ccdc","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a5f4a227d6404a","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:201bf55c2c14d0","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:43de5d7d9a7af4","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:2d13968ff4efdd"]}],"source_bindings":[{"content_sha256":"9e14ba05f2a6db7154d4e5b86b4b1baf170005551bdedde902034b4571e06303","locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:0bbc32d43d7c675bf19f9a1d","role":"current_working_draft_packet","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:0bbc32d43d7c675bf19f9a1d","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","source_version":"full-draft:c0b359476f04d3b8f63197b60167afce3392f38065448042867a9942faf64dd5:0bbc32d43d7c675bf19f9a1d","text_sha256":"9e14ba05f2a6db7154d4e5b86b4b1baf170005551bdedde902034b4571e06303"},{"content_sha256":"787313a6f081b1c9afdf03800feb1c50c317aa4aa4f0c3884e924b0594e666da","locator":"study